---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import profileImg from "~/assets/imgs/profile.webp"
import Window from "~/components/Window.astro"

const upworkUrl = "https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/shrjamal"
---

<Window
  id="about"
  title="about.md"
  class="flex-[1_1_380px] rotate-[0.5deg]"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 p-[clamp(22px,3vw,36px)]">
    <h2 class="text-[clamp(28px,3.2vw,42px)] leading-[1.02] font-bold tracking-[-0.035em]">
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="font-mono font-medium text-accent"># </span
      >Who you work with
    </h2>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <Image
        src={profileImg}
        alt="Jamal Shr"
        width={128}
        height={128}
        class="size-16 flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-edge object-cover"
      />
      <div>
        <div class="text-lg font-semibold">Jamal Shr</div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-muted">Founder · Software developer · Morocco</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[16px] leading-[1.65]">
      <p>
        SAJAM is run by Jamal Shr, a software developer from Morocco. Most of the projects on this
        page were built for clients through Upwork, from the first plan to launch, and the rest are
        products we run ourselves.
      </p>
      <p>
        Running our own products means the work does not stop at a clean demo. We deal with billing,
        uptime, support, bug reports, and the small decisions that keep software useful. That shapes
        how we build for clients: fewer surprises, sensible tradeoffs, and code the next person can
        understand.
      </p>
      <p>
        Several of these projects are being prepared as open source. Their repositories will be
        linked from each case study as they are released.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a
      href={upworkUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="btn self-start font-mono text-sm"
    >
      Client reviews on Upwork ↗
    </a>
  </div>
</Window>
